          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Born with the mark of the Summoner, Joseph possesses a power greater than emperors and gods. As a child, he summoned a demon to save his village, and watched in horror as those he loved were destroyed. Nine years later, the armies of Orenia invade, and Joseph must confront the prophecy he was born to fulfill.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Nacido con la marca del Invocador, Joseph posee un poder superior al de emperadores y dioses. De niño invocó a un demonio para salvar su aldea y contempló con horror cómo eran destruidos quienes amaba. Nueve años después, los ejércitos de Orenia invaden la región, y Joseph debe enfrentarse a la profecía que nació para cumplir.",
